@startuml
' State diagram: a login - Inventory & POS System v0.32.0 (report, Lecture 5-7; redrawn 2026-10-27)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

[*] --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut : no login record for this browser
WaitingForCode : right password, code sent;\n"half logged in" for 5 minutes
LoggedIn : login record exists,\nused in the last 8 hours
Ended : record deleted or too old;\nthe browser still has the cookie
LoggedOut --> LoggedOut : wrong password\n(5 tries = wait 5 minutes)
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : right password on a\ntrusted browser
LoggedOut --> WaitingForCode : right password,\nbrowser not trusted
WaitingForCode --> LoggedIn : right code (or backup code)\n(new record, new token)
WaitingForCode --> WaitingForCode : wrong code\n(5 tries, then a new code)
WaitingForCode --> LoggedOut : 5 minutes pass
LoggedIn --> LoggedIn : any page within 8 hours\n(last seen updated)
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : Log out (record deleted)
LoggedIn --> Ended : password changed, Log out everywhere,\naccount switched off
LoggedIn --> Ended : 8 hours without a request
Ended --> LoggedOut : next request\n(sent to log in, basket emptied)
@enduml
